      "raw": "[quote=\"Reckless\"]\n\nDevastation of Indines features Legacy as a fighter kit with four Strikers (cards representing fighters in the game that can &quot;assist&quot; the main fighter) as the remaining Freedom Five members (which can be used with Legacy or with other fighters).\n\n[/quote]\n\nLegacy&#39;s kind of a weird one as far as crossovers go because promo characters for Devastation aren&#39;t legal in official tournament play. So even though in principle there&#39;s no storyline reason in either universe that Legacy couldn&#39;t show up in Indines (via spaceship or interdimensional portal or what have you), it would seem that any such appearance is non-canonical.\n",
