    {
      "id": 65950,
      "name": "Katsue",
      "username": "Katsue",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-16T10:23:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kingofsouls\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/58f4c7/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kingofsouls:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm al little lost. What is Destruction of Indines?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Devastation of Indines is a card game using the Battlecon system. (The first Battlecon game was War of Indines). It's a strategy game intended to emulate 2d fighting games like Streetfighter, set in the high-magitech fantasy world of Indines.</p>\n<p>In Battlecon, characters simultaneously and secretly select their attack, which consists of a Base (a particular type of attack, e.g. a charge or a fireball) and a Style which modifies that attack. All (or almost all) characters have access to the same six Bases, plus their own unique Base, 5 Styles, a unique ability, and a Finisher. There are 30 characters in the base Devastation box, and they all feel different, so there should be a lot of replayability.</p>\n<p>The post that announced the Legacy promo character is below. Strikers (which are an optional expansion element) are explained on the first page of that Kickstarter.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/level99games/battlecon-devastation-of-indines-a-dueling-card-ga/posts/380540\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/level99games/battlecon-devastation-of-indines-a-dueling-card-ga/posts/380540</a></p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:43:31.018Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
