      "raw": "[quote=\"Kingofsouls\"]\n\nI&#39;m al little lost. What is Destruction of Indines?\n\n[/quote]\n\nDevastation of Indines is a card game using the Battlecon system. (The first Battlecon game was War of Indines). It&#39;s a strategy game intended to emulate 2d fighting games like Streetfighter, set in the high-magitech fantasy world of Indines.\n\nIn Battlecon, characters simultaneously and secretly select their attack, which consists of a Base (a particular type of attack, e.g. a charge or a fireball) and a Style which modifies that attack. All (or almost all) characters have access to the same six Bases, plus their own unique Base, 5 Styles, a unique ability, and a Finisher. There are 30 characters in the base Devastation box, and they all feel different, so there should be a lot of replayability.\n\nThe post that announced the Legacy promo character is below. Strikers (which are an optional expansion element) are explained on the first page of that Kickstarter.\n\nhttp://www.kickstarter.com/projects/level99games/battlecon-devastation-of-indines-a-dueling-card-ga/posts/380540\n",
